      "end_time": 321.03
    },
    {
      "text": "Great to hear.",
      "speaker_name": "William Belle",
      "start_time": 321.03,
      "end_time": 321.67
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "William Belle",
      "start_time": 321.67,
      "end_time": 322.19
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it would be good to get a breakdown on the client mix, which clients they're servicing and then what services they're rendering so we can get a grasp on, you know, hey look, is this something that we want to buy and if we do, can we scale it?",
